  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IpIRbkZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"643\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">《遊玩日》終於迎來期待已久的改版！享受各式各樣的新玩具，在你的 Minecraft 世界裡再次感受童趣！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playdate/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看 Forge 與 Fabric 版本請點此。</a></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">🧸&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXC6Xh82yT\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord！</a>&nbsp;🧸</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;製作團隊：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 🎨 Frogipher#4778（美術）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 💻 ThatGravyBoat#0001（程式）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;🎵 Ozyk#0660（自訂音樂）<br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;自 1.19 版本起，本模組的恐怖元素已移除。</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">只要註明出處，《遊玩日》可用於模組包、YouTube 影片等用途。</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>",
